Here is the continuation and completion of the IntarsiaML architecture plan, picking up from the `mermaid` diagram and completing the system overview, followed by the detailed architectural layers and implementation strategy.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  subgraph Front["Front door (crate: intarsia-server)"]
    OAI["OpenAI: /v1/chat/completions, /v1/completions, /v1/responses, /v1/models"]
    ANT["Anthropic: /v1/messages"]
    UI["Embedded web UI: chat, live dashboard, live architecture map"]
    MET["/metrics (Prometheus), OTLP, /events (SSE)"]
  end
  subgraph Core["Engine core (crate: intarsia-core)"]
    SCHED["Scheduler: Pre-fill, Decode, KV-cache management"]
    MODEL["Model Router: Recipe loader, Block dispatcher"]
    KV["KV Cache: Paged, zero-copy, cross-device sync"]
  end
  subgraph Kernels["Kernel Packs (Crate: intarsia-kernels)"]
    TF["TensorFold: CUDA/HIP GEMM, MoE, FlashAttention
